(module PWRM-TH_PTH12050WAH (layer F.Cu) (tedit 0)
	(descr "TI PTH12050WAH 6-A wide-output-adjust power module, EUU (R-PDSS-T6) horizontal through-hole, suffix H. Hand-built from the SLTS214H mechanical drawing 4205246-4/C: two pin columns 19.06 mm apart, left column pins 1-4 at 3.175 mm pitch, pin 6 opposite pin 1 and pin 5 opposite pin 4; 6x 1.40 mm plated through holes for 1.02 mm pins; body 22.10 x 12.57 mm, recommended keepout 23.12 x 13.59 mm.")
